<title>SWITZERLAND: Geneva December inflation steady at 0.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Geneva December inflation steady at 0.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in Geneva rose 0.1 percent in December from the previous month for a year-on-year rise of 0.7 percent, the city's statistics office said.</p>
<p>				    Dec 1996	Nov 1996	Dec 1995</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   0.1 pct	 0.7 pct	 0.1 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		0.7 pct	-0.2 pct	 1.9 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	 104.0	   103.9	   103.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Geneva is Switzerland's third largest city and its inflation helps give an indication of the national trend.</p>
<p>--- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
